  "description": "JEWEL FOR THRIATHLETES…A WINNING ALLY! BOLIDE F TR is Pinarello's answer to the evolution of the Triathlon world. Brought by Cameron Wurf to debut in the fantastic scenery of Kona, in Hawaii it immediately set the record in the road segment that it already held since the last edition. BOLIDE F TR is made of TorayCa T1100 1K carbon which, thanks to its extraordinary stiffness and comfort characteristics, makes it perfect for all triathletes engaged in the toughest no-draft competitions. The PinaLab technicians worked on driveability and comfort, also designing object holders perfectly integrated on the frame tested in the wind tunnel.",
